s as the administrator user and restarts on failure with six retries. The job sends an invoice file to a partner. After a timeout the platform runs it six more times, and the partner receives seven files. A job with an external effect must not be retried by the platform.\n\n## What to record\n\n- The base image reference, its digest and whether it was pinned.\n- The resource quantities and the arguments.\n- The image reference that replaced the placeholder at deployment.\n\n## Source\n\n- `src/loop_engine/code_nodes/solution_export.py`: `ContainerSpec`, `render_dockerfile` and `render_kubernetes_job`.\n\nLicence: MIT. Compiled from revision 4be111f. The render functions use only the Python standard library.\n",
